.Sh DESCRIPTION
A peer represents the local end of a BitTorrent wire protocol connection.
It drives the state machine from handshake through active data exchange,
reporting events up through callbacks and issuing commands downward.
.Pp
The state machine progresses through:
.Bl -tag -width MBT_PEER_ACTIVE
.It Va MBT_PEER_CONNECTING
Establishing TCP connection.
.It Va MBT_PEER_HANDSHAKE
Performing bitfield handshake.
.It Va MBT_PEER_EXTENSION
Negotiating BEP 10 extensions.
.It Va MBT_PEER_ACTIVE
Exchanging piece data.
.It Va MBT_PEER_CLOSED
Connection terminated or errored.
.El
.Ss Creation
.Fn mbt_peer_new
creates a peer from an outbound connection; the peer takes ownership of
.Fa conn .
The
.Fa cb
callbacks receive events as they arrive.
.Pp
.Fn mbt_peer_new_incoming
creates a peer from an inbound connection where the handshake has already been completed.
.Ss Commands
After a peer reaches active state, the caller sends wire messages down through these commands:
.Pp
.Fn mbt_peer_send_choke
and
.Fn mbt_peer_send_interested
control choking state (tit-for-tat).
.Fn mbt_peer_send_request
asks for a piece block.
.Fn mbt_peer_send_have
advertises a completed piece.
.Fn mbt_peer_send_bitfield
sends the full bitfield on activation (for seeding peers).
.Pp
.Fn mbt_peer_send_piece
responds to an incoming request by sending piece data; it handles reassembly and flow control internally so callers do not need buffering logic.
.Ss Accessors
.Fn mbt_peer_addr
returns the remote IP address string.
.Fn mbt_peer_port
returns the remote listen port as advertised in the handshake.
.Fn mbt_peer_conn_port
returns the ephemeral TCP source port of the connection, which differs from
.Fn mbt_peer_port
for inbound peers.
.Fn mbt_peer_version
returns the BEP 10 client version string
.Pq the Dq v
key from the extension handshake, or NULL if not available.
.Fn mbt_peer_set_our_listen_port
sets the listen port advertised to this peer in the BEP 10 handshake.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Functions returning
.Ft int
return 0 on success or a negative errno value on failure.
