.Pp
.Fn mbt_peer_source_str
returns a human-readable string for the given
.Fa source
enum value (e.g., "tracker", "dht", "lsd").
.Pp
.Fn mbt_peer_set_our_metadata_size
sets the metadata size advertised in the extension handshake.
Called internally when metadata becomes available.
.Pp
.Fn mbt_peer_set_our_reqq
sets the maximum outstanding requests advertised to the remote peer.
.Pp
.Fn mbt_peer_set_piece_count
updates the peer's piece count after metadata is received,
applying any deferred HAVE_ALL bitfield.
.Pp
.Fn mbt_peer_ut_pex_id
returns the extension message ID for PEX (ut_pex) as negotiated
with this peer, or 0 if unsupported.
